<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-OB Brewery H1 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>TABLE-OB Brewery H1 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				  -8,315 vs -16,237</p>
<p>    Net (both loss)			   33.88 vs 66.16</p>
<p>    Profit before tax (both loss)	 33.88 vs 65.55</p>
<p>    Turnover				   197.98 vs 176.77</p>
<p>Note - OB Brewery Co Ltd, a unit of the Doosan Group, is one of South Korea's leading beer producers. The figures were provided by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5645</p>
</text>
